  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Nutrition project Joint Programme to Improve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to reduce stunting in Sierra Leone by (i) building climate resilience, increasing the availability of safe, diverse foods and strengthening livelihood support for the most vulnerable populations; (ii) increasing equitable access to quality, gender-responsive, climate resilient essential nutrition specific and nutrition sensitive services at community and facility levels and (iii) strengthening nutrition, food and climate governance and advocacy. The programme directly targets 255,064 beneficiaries in four districts.</narrative>
  </description>
